      "value": "@{5c8f538975056470640f1d9f|full_name}: that wont work since not everyone wears their trackers the same. head and hands will always be in the same spot, but you can wear your trackers on the side of your hip and ankles, or behind your hip and on your feet.\n\nhaving predetermined calibration points like that would make 99% of models not track properly",
